{"title":"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2cf88d3b9ba7b1e32cdd59fd4e1e58e2157d48f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 5 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />, the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/1/7d1aff99fa9ec78cc038f5f8d8c83d780be5714d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 5 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ -5 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 10 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ -10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"451\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply solve the equation:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2cf88d3b9ba7b1e32cdd59fd4e1e58e2157d48f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 5 = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/a/74a74ca73746006fafa7bbc0fb202292d6e13a6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 15 + 5 = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845bcea93bf0d6358c0723111dbfa35a2336cc77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 20 \\div 2 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"175\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2